  <title>Time clock projects</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Time clock</gui><gui>Time clock
  projects</gui></guiseq>: choose the job or project, and the employees who
  worked on it are listed with their <gui>Actual</gui> time punched and their
  <gui>Adjusted</gui> time after corrections in the <link
  xref="time_clock_tool"/>. Each punch is listed beside them, with its
  <gui>Punch in</gui>, <gui>Punch out</gui> and <gui>Time</gui>. A note says
  when nobody has punched in on it.</p>

  <p>Double click an employee, then click <gui>Report</gui> to open a time
  report for them in LibreOffice, to print.</p>

</page>
